<title>USA: Lake Michigan College won by Baird.</title>
<headline>Lake Michigan College won by Baird.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert W Baird said Tuesday it won $4.5 million Lake Michigan College, Mich., 1997 community college facilities limited tax bonds with a net interest cost of 4.7275 percent.</p>
</text>
